            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "xenaxahid"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe. My son eats pasta all the time so I make this and freeze (without baking). When it's time to eat I just pop a few slices into the oven for 5 min at 170C and it's done! This way we have garlic bread in a flash any time we need!",
            "datePublished": "2013-12-27T21:37:50.570Z"
